{"id":836,"date":"2020-11-10T11:23:40","date_gmt":"2020-11-10T19:23:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/?post_type=lesson&#038;p=836"},"modified":"2024-09-01T15:59:03","modified_gmt":"2024-09-01T22:59:03","slug":"codrone-arduino-overview","status":"publish","type":"lesson","link":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/codrone-arduino-overview\/","title":{"rendered":"CoDrone Pro Overview"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a221595108ad\" name=\"6a221595108ad\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 1<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Overview<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]The CoDrone is a compact, intelligent, innovative, and (most importantly) flying learning platform for students of ALL ages! The combination of a drone driven by sensors with the Arduino programming environment means that subject matter connections and customization are endless.[\/vc_column_text][vc_video link=&#8221;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Z1wfXYbzz2g&amp;feature=emb_logo&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a221595109e3\" name=\"6a221595109e3\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 2<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Features<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]<strong>On-Board Sensors<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gyroscopes<\/li>\n<li>Accelerometers<\/li>\n<li>Barometer<\/li>\n<li>IR sensors<\/li>\n<li>Optical flow sensor<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customizable controller<\/li>\n<li>Additional controller pins<\/li>\n<li>Easily removable and replaceable parts<\/li>\n<li>Programmable onboard LEDs<\/li>\n<li>Arduino IDE\u00a0with online lessons\u00a0and support<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Smart Inventor Board<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>7 digital IR sensors<\/li>\n<li>3 analog IR sensors<\/li>\n<li>4 DC motor ports<\/li>\n<li>5 analog SVG pins<\/li>\n<li>5 digital SVG pins<\/li>\n<li>1 buzzer<\/li>\n<li>8 LEDs<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Capabilities<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Self-stabilization<\/li>\n<li>Altitude hold<\/li>\n<li>Bluetooth smartphone control<\/li>\n<li>Sensor data feedback<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;839&#8243; img_size=&#8221;large&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a22159510a42\" name=\"6a22159510a42\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 3<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Safety<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<div class=\"activity2__rtf\">\n<p>Please watch the CoDrone safety video.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_video link=&#8221;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=dPpJ21qlPnI&amp;feature=emb_logo&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a22159510a95\" name=\"6a22159510a95\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 4<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>CoDrone in a classroom<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<div class=\"activity2__rtf\">\n<p>Watch this video if you plan on using CoDrone in a classroom.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_video link=&#8221;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Zz9MxG8wYuw&amp;feature=emb_logo&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"[vc_row][vc_column] Step 5 Overview [vc_column_text]The CoDrone is a compact, intelligent, innovative, and (most importantly) flying learning platform for students of ALL ages! The combination of a drone driven by sensors&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/codrone-arduino-overview\/\">&hellip;<\/a>","protected":false},"featured